<title>USA: Advanced gets order from Hyundai.</title>
<headline>Advanced gets order from Hyundai.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Technology Materials Inc, a producer of equipment and materials for the semiconductor industry, said on Friday it received a $4.4 million order from Hyundai Corp's American division, called Huydai Semiconductor America Inc.</p>
<p>Advanced Technology said its EcoSys division is providing environmental equipment and monitoring services for Hyundai's fabrication plant in Eugene, Oregon.</p>
<p>Product shipments and initial installation began during the first quarter.</p>
